1
00:00:00,000 --> 00:00:01,580
The grain is right there.

2
00:00:02,380 --> 00:00:03,960
But can this household reach it?

3
00:00:04,800 --> 00:00:05,620
Watch the connection.

4
00:00:06,320 --> 00:00:08,900
As pressure builds, the route narrows.

5
00:00:09,480 --> 00:00:10,900
The basket is still full.

6
00:00:11,480 --> 00:00:12,700
No grain has disappeared.

7
00:00:13,500 --> 00:00:15,060
What changed is access.

8
00:00:15,760 --> 00:00:19,740
And for the household, that changes what it can actually use.
